Current result export completed for Car reconstruction and Airfoil.

Car:7400 accuracy pairs;990 physical timing and memory conditions;99000 formal repeats plus19800 warmups.
Airfoil:10230 accuracy requests including Full-only conv-temp;1323 timing and memory conditions;132300 formal repeats plus26460 warmups.

Original Airfoil finalizer failed after measurement completion due to a repeated reuse_assumption keyword. This new independent aggregator recovered summary tables from the complete raw groups; original files, failure log and status were preserved.

Frozen source/asset hashes, same-prediction old/new parity, case/seed/budget coverage, timing output alignment, per-condition and pooled direct median/p95, reconstruction profiles, memory matching, rAUEC and cache estimates were checked. The independent CSV-only verifier passed. Slower Airfoil rows were retained.

README.md explains exactly which protocols were tested and which remain outside this package. Raw repeats and wide scalar profile tables have deterministic gzip copies with both compressed and LF-uncompressed hashes. No weights, raw CFD arrays, or original long logs are designated public.

Seven figure/table families and captions were generated from CSV. Root owns the authorized Git commit/push and final remote verification; this worker performed no Git mutations.
